<% content_for :title, "Privacy" %>
<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 md:px-8">
  <p class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-algae-900 dark:text-algae-300">Privacy</p>
  <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Your people's data stays yours.</h1>
  <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#3d4742] dark:text-[#C6CFC9]">
    <p>Trellixe stores contact details, prayer requests, and visit notes so your team can follow up with care. That data belongs to your workspace — we never sell it, and we never use it for advertising.</p>
    <p>Workspace admins control who sees what. When someone leaves the team, remove them and their access ends immediately. Delete a contact and their history goes with them.</p>
    <p>Questions about your data? Write to us from the contact page and a human replies.</p>
  </div>
  <%= link_to "Back home", root_path, class: "mt-8 inline-flex rounded-lg border border-[#D9DDE0] bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-[#A2E494] dark:bg-[#131B17] dark:border-white/10" %>
</div>
